description:
ai-crawler-visibility-audit: AI crawler visibility audit: is your website visible to GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot and OAI-SearchBot? Fetched like an AI crawler, without JavaScript: robots.txt, llms.txt, sitemap, soft 404, JSON-LD, crawlers blocked at the edge. Every finding with evidence and a fix. $0.01 USDC per check; pass = dated badge and a registry listing.
Method: GET
Input: {"site": "string, required - https URL of the website (query parameter)"}
